{"id":"vod_lz_32186","vodId":"32186","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"钢之炼金术师","name_cn":"钢之炼金术师","date":"2003-01-01","year":"2003","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20220828-1/b89ffe56a2799f7ee2fab57f57649c6d.jpg"},"summary":"　　年幼的爱力克兄弟十分思念去世的母亲，不惜触犯炼金术中最大的禁忌，进行了人体炼成。可是炼成失败了，哥哥爱德华失去了左腿与右臂，弟弟阿尔冯斯失去了肉体，只能把灵魂附身在一副铠甲上。为了偿还他们自己的罪，找回失去的一切，兄弟二人踏上了寻找传说中的“贤者之石”的旅程。　　几年后，一位右臂与左腿都是由“机械铠甲”替代的国家炼金术士出现在人们的眼前，他被称作“钢之炼金术师”。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"喜剧,科幻,动画,悬疑,恐怖"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2022-08-28 23:39:12","classic":true,"classicRank":9,"franchise":"钢之炼金术师","playable":true,"episodeCount":51,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn.com/20220825/29430_afaed95f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn.com/20220825/29432_f68407d1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn.com/20220825/29433_08fc00dc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn.com/20220825/29434_6cd45e9c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn.com/20220825/29435_cb3d730c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn.com/20220825/29436_109ec402/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn.com/20220825/29437_62e4c43f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn.com/20220825/29438_ec38fa25/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn.com/20220825/29439_e80a3c7a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn.com/20220825/29441_ab313c71/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn.com/20220825/29440_915f1c49/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn.com/20220825/29442_66b4c40d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn.com/20220825/29443_1cd68230/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn.com/20220825/29444_d07007c2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn.com/20220825/29446_964b07e9/index.m